WEBVTT

01:44.375 --> 01:48.333
Choose wisely, now.
A sky bison's a companion for life.

01:57.333 --> 01:58.708
I have an apple for you.

01:58.791 --> 02:00.500
They're so beautiful!

02:06.416 --> 02:07.833
Mmm.

02:18.750 --> 02:19.916
Here you are.

02:21.125 --> 02:22.958
-Catch!
-Wait for me!

02:29.000 --> 02:30.375
He's matching me!

02:31.916 --> 02:33.500
Here! Now down here!

03:17.791 --> 03:20.458
I guess this means
we'll always be together.

03:44.458 --> 03:45.333
Appa.

03:59.750 --> 04:01.291
Where did he go?

04:02.208 --> 04:03.208
Find him!

04:27.458 --> 04:30.000
As soon as I can move again,
you guys are in big trouble.

04:30.083 --> 04:32.458
You with the creaky boots,
I'm gonna remember you.

04:34.333 --> 04:35.833
And you too, mouth breather.

04:35.916 --> 04:38.916
Too lazy to carry me to jail, huh?
Gotta drag me.

04:40.625 --> 04:42.625
Both of you inhuman goons!

04:43.708 --> 04:46.500
What? No, come back! No!

04:46.583 --> 04:47.708
You can't just…

04:49.250 --> 04:50.250
You did.

04:50.916 --> 04:52.541
You just left me like this.

04:59.125 --> 05:00.125
Who is it?

05:00.791 --> 05:01.750
Who's there?

05:03.125 --> 05:04.041
Sokka.

05:04.125 --> 05:04.958
Sai?

05:05.041 --> 05:05.958
You're alive?

05:06.041 --> 05:08.666
Sokka! I thought I'd never see you again.

05:08.750 --> 05:10.875
We've been looking all over for you.

05:10.958 --> 05:13.666
Have you seen Amita? Or heard from Teo?

05:14.541 --> 05:16.500
No, they probably confiscate any letters.

05:16.583 --> 05:19.041
But, Sokka, I'm so glad to see you.

05:19.125 --> 05:20.250
So, so glad!

05:20.333 --> 05:21.875
-Uh, Sai?
-Uh-huh?

05:22.625 --> 05:24.125
Can you turn me over?

05:24.750 --> 05:28.083
So you're telling me
that you and Dad had no idea

05:28.166 --> 05:30.208
you were building weapons
for the Fire Nation?

05:33.166 --> 05:35.833
Did I know we had contracts
with the Fire Nation?

05:35.916 --> 05:36.916
Yes.

05:37.833 --> 05:40.583
But I promise you,
I thought they were for farming equipment.

05:41.541 --> 05:43.583
-Business knows no--
-No borders.

05:43.666 --> 05:45.000
So I've been learning.

05:48.250 --> 05:49.916
The contracts will be canceled.

05:51.166 --> 05:52.000
Really?

05:52.083 --> 05:53.916
I'll take care of it immediately.

05:54.750 --> 05:57.708
I always hoped
you'd take over for us one day, so

05:58.500 --> 06:01.208
you might as well start
shaping the business as you see fit.

06:04.916 --> 06:06.250
I mean, as you

06:06.791 --> 06:08.541
wish it to be.

06:12.750 --> 06:16.583
I've heard you've turned the Avatar
into a fine Earthbender.

06:18.208 --> 06:20.208
If you'd shared your talents
with me sooner,

06:20.291 --> 06:22.000
I might not have reacted so strongly.

06:22.083 --> 06:24.833
This isn't a business negotiation, Mom.

06:24.916 --> 06:28.250
Why can't you just talk to me
like I'm your daughter? I…

06:30.583 --> 06:32.750
I don't know how.

06:32.833 --> 06:34.791
Just think of me as any other person.

06:34.875 --> 06:36.666
But you're not any other person.

06:36.750 --> 06:37.916
You're my fragile--

06:38.000 --> 06:40.375
-Don't call me fragile.
-Please.

06:40.458 --> 06:42.500
Give me just a moment.

06:50.000 --> 06:51.416
When you have a child,

06:53.000 --> 06:56.958
you think… you're gonna guide them
through the world.

06:58.458 --> 07:02.250
That you'll share what you learned
from your own life.

07:04.250 --> 07:05.958
From the moment you were born,

07:06.041 --> 07:10.833
I knew you were gonna have to deal with
things I could never imagine

07:11.666 --> 07:16.125
because I have no idea
what it's like to be

07:17.500 --> 07:18.375
blind.

07:20.041 --> 07:21.708
After you left,

07:22.625 --> 07:23.666
I wondered…

07:26.166 --> 07:29.666
"Perhaps I am the fragile one."

07:31.416 --> 07:35.625
You navigate the world with more strength,

07:36.500 --> 07:40.250
confidence, and grace
than any Beifong before you.

07:41.166 --> 07:42.208
I mean,

07:43.166 --> 07:44.541
maybe not grace.

07:44.625 --> 07:46.208
Why do you say that?

07:46.708 --> 07:48.083
I don't know. Uh…

07:48.166 --> 07:51.458
Don't you ever feel like
people just assume

07:51.541 --> 07:53.916
we're gonna act a certain way
because of our name?

07:55.708 --> 07:57.833
My whole life.

08:03.333 --> 08:05.875
I got into a fight with my friends.

08:07.083 --> 08:08.166
The Avatar?

08:08.666 --> 08:09.708
Yeah.

08:09.791 --> 08:12.625
I thought they understood me, but I don't…

08:14.291 --> 08:15.250
I don't know.

08:16.500 --> 08:17.458
Listen.

08:18.458 --> 08:20.416
I know you want me to come home.

08:20.500 --> 08:21.791
I do.

08:22.291 --> 08:24.625
It's why I'm here.

08:25.291 --> 08:26.583
I promise you,

08:27.583 --> 08:29.250
things will be different.

08:36.291 --> 08:37.583
I'm just not ready.

08:39.791 --> 08:42.333
I mean, I have to at least talk to them.

08:43.083 --> 08:44.583
To make things right.

08:48.458 --> 08:50.708
You have to do
what you think is right, of course.

08:51.291 --> 08:53.666
I do have a carriage waiting, so…

08:55.083 --> 08:56.833
-Whenever you're ready to go.
-Don't…

08:58.333 --> 08:59.416
Don't wait for me.

09:00.666 --> 09:02.041
It may take some time.

09:02.750 --> 09:03.791
Hmm.

09:04.958 --> 09:07.208
Take all the time you need.

09:21.083 --> 09:24.916
Just let's finish our tea together.

09:27.291 --> 09:28.500
Like when you were little.

09:45.875 --> 09:47.083
Mmm.

09:47.791 --> 09:51.041
You would not believe
how many marriage proposals I've gotten

09:51.125 --> 09:52.291
since arriving here.

09:54.625 --> 09:57.208
Men are the worst, aren't they?

10:01.000 --> 10:04.166
Like those two fools
your father sent after you.

10:04.250 --> 10:05.625
Mom, I don't…

10:08.041 --> 10:10.875
I feel weird.

10:12.583 --> 10:14.666
I should've come after you myself.

10:25.541 --> 10:28.125
We could've done this a long time ago.

10:58.291 --> 10:59.250
I'm sorry.

11:00.083 --> 11:01.625
It's my fault we're here.

11:08.208 --> 11:09.291
Who are you?

11:11.958 --> 11:13.208
You don't wanna know.

11:15.583 --> 11:18.833
You got captured trying to help me.
Of course I wanna know.

11:19.833 --> 11:21.375
I wanna thank you.

11:23.250 --> 11:24.333
You won't.

11:27.583 --> 11:29.250
Now you really need to turn around.

11:39.666 --> 11:40.708
Zuko?

11:45.541 --> 11:47.500
What do we do now? Fight to the death?

11:47.583 --> 11:48.750
I'm not gonna fight you.

11:48.833 --> 11:50.375
Oh, wow.

11:50.875 --> 11:51.833
You.

11:52.750 --> 11:53.916
You!

11:56.708 --> 11:58.833
-I'm such an idiot.
-You're not.

12:00.375 --> 12:03.041
-And I thought you were good. I…
-I'm trying.

12:03.125 --> 12:04.458
Aang was right.

12:06.833 --> 12:08.083
They were all right.

12:09.250 --> 12:11.333
Everything I did was stupid.

12:11.833 --> 12:13.166
And selfish.

12:14.125 --> 12:17.375
And I put us all in danger,
and this is what I deserve.

12:17.458 --> 12:20.041
To be locked in a cave with a monster.

12:30.708 --> 12:32.500
My friends,

12:32.583 --> 12:35.458
you must be wondering why
I called you here today.

12:35.541 --> 12:38.125
The Earth King has become aware of a plot

12:38.208 --> 12:40.708
to undermine the security of the city.

12:40.791 --> 12:43.875
His Majesty has ordered me
to weed out the conspirators,

12:43.958 --> 12:46.291
some of whom are at this table.

12:46.375 --> 12:47.541
Where is General Sung?

12:47.625 --> 12:49.666
General Sung is under arrest for treason.

12:49.750 --> 12:50.708
-Treason?
-Treason?

12:50.791 --> 12:53.625
The Earth King has ordered the Dai Li
to take control of the military.

12:53.708 --> 12:54.541
This is a coup!

12:54.625 --> 12:56.250
-The Supreme Commander…
-Where is the king?

12:56.333 --> 12:57.958
…has shown herself to be disloyal.

12:58.041 --> 12:59.666
We demand to speak to the king.

12:59.750 --> 13:02.625
Then we'll see who
really holds the power here, Long Feng.

13:02.708 --> 13:04.958
Perhaps I can illuminate that for you.

13:05.958 --> 13:10.083
What do the Kyoshi Warriors have to do
with the affairs of Ba Sing Se?

13:11.291 --> 13:12.333
Nothing.

13:13.416 --> 13:14.708
No, wait!

13:28.541 --> 13:30.541
I've changed my mind about our deal.

13:34.208 --> 13:35.791
I'll take the fugitives.

13:37.583 --> 13:39.125
And the Avatar.

13:40.375 --> 13:41.666
And the city.

13:44.000 --> 13:46.500
Ba Sing Se belongs to the Fire Nation now.

13:49.125 --> 13:51.000
Did you have anything to say about that?

13:53.041 --> 13:54.000
No,

13:55.875 --> 13:57.041
Princess.

14:01.166 --> 14:02.291
As you were.

14:12.208 --> 14:13.416
What did we miss?

14:32.625 --> 14:33.458
It's a good name.

14:35.166 --> 14:36.333
Serene.

14:36.416 --> 14:37.541
But fierce.

14:38.583 --> 14:41.416
To name something
is to dream of its future

14:41.500 --> 14:43.583
and the place it will hold in the world.

14:44.583 --> 14:45.833
Bo! Yize!

14:45.916 --> 14:48.750
Welcome to the Jasmine Dragon. Your usual?

14:48.833 --> 14:51.708
I'll need the special, Mushi.
I barely slept last night.

14:51.791 --> 14:55.291
Dai Li made an arrest outside my house.
They found the Painted Lady.

14:55.375 --> 14:56.333
And her sidekick.

14:56.416 --> 14:58.708
Yeah, that guy in the blue mask?
They got him too.

14:58.791 --> 15:01.208
-That's what good deeds get you.
-Mushi, I'll take…

15:01.291 --> 15:02.416
Mushi?

15:03.791 --> 15:04.875
My tea.

15:35.333 --> 15:36.791
Coast is clear.

15:37.375 --> 15:38.333
For now.

15:42.041 --> 15:43.625
Thanks for hiding us.

15:43.708 --> 15:46.000
The Dai Li are everywhere today.

15:46.083 --> 15:49.041
And I found out
the Painted Lady was arrested last night.

15:49.125 --> 15:49.958
Katara?

15:50.041 --> 15:52.958
She is the only reason
why we're all still in this fight.

15:54.333 --> 15:57.250
Also, Toph Beifong left the city
this morning with her mother.

15:57.333 --> 15:58.708
She what?

15:58.791 --> 15:59.791
I don't know.

16:01.041 --> 16:02.041
What about Sokka?

16:02.125 --> 16:03.291
No sign of him.

16:07.708 --> 16:10.250
The Dai Li have
a secret prison underground.

16:10.333 --> 16:11.791
Has to be where they're holding them.

16:11.875 --> 16:14.583
One of us from Omashu
could tail a Dai Li agent.

16:14.666 --> 16:16.333
We all wanna help.

16:16.416 --> 16:17.708
It's too dangerous.

16:19.416 --> 16:22.125
I moved from Senlin to Gaipan,

16:22.625 --> 16:24.208
and the war followed.

16:24.291 --> 16:27.750
Then I moved to Omashu,
and the war followed. Now we're here.

16:29.333 --> 16:31.875
We can't escape the danger.

16:32.375 --> 16:33.791
We have to face it.

16:35.166 --> 16:36.083
Okay.

16:37.166 --> 16:38.708
But I'll handle this one.

16:39.416 --> 16:41.125
Okay.

16:43.500 --> 16:47.125
Just please… be careful, Aang.

16:47.208 --> 16:48.208
Yeah.

16:49.583 --> 16:52.416
And when you find Sai, just tell him…

16:53.000 --> 16:53.916
Yeah.

16:54.958 --> 16:55.791
I will.

16:58.208 --> 16:59.416
Thank you.

17:05.500 --> 17:08.541
The Dai Li have taken over
military leadership of the wall guard,

17:08.625 --> 17:13.500
which means the forces are now
under our com… your command.

17:14.000 --> 17:17.166
We have also captured
all of the Avatar's companions,

17:17.250 --> 17:19.625
but the Avatar himself eludes us.

17:20.625 --> 17:22.541
He will come for his friends.

17:27.500 --> 17:29.708
Someone else was captured last night.

17:32.291 --> 17:33.541
He had these.

17:36.250 --> 17:37.250
Where is he now?

17:37.333 --> 17:38.666
Lake Laogai.

17:49.375 --> 17:52.166
She said she was gonna kill Zuko.

17:52.708 --> 17:53.708
Yes.

17:54.375 --> 17:56.250
You brought her the swords.

17:57.916 --> 17:58.875
Yes.

17:59.625 --> 18:01.833
You told her where Zuko was.

18:05.625 --> 18:07.708
I brought gifts…

18:07.791 --> 18:08.750
Yes.

18:10.416 --> 18:13.083
A symbol of unity between our people.

18:14.083 --> 18:15.083
Uh-huh.

18:19.958 --> 18:22.333
Don't you kind of love Zuko?

18:27.375 --> 18:28.750
Well, I love you.

18:31.583 --> 18:33.208
But I would've killed you.

18:34.541 --> 18:35.458
Yeah.

18:37.250 --> 18:38.541
It's true.

18:58.500 --> 18:59.875
I could bend that open.

19:01.000 --> 19:02.000
Wouldn't be too hard.

19:10.958 --> 19:13.041
Maybe it'll be a little hard.

19:21.375 --> 19:22.750
General Iroh.

19:24.541 --> 19:25.666
What are you doing here?

19:25.750 --> 19:26.916
I'm no general.

19:27.416 --> 19:28.541
Not anymore.

19:30.375 --> 19:34.000
I'm here for the same reason you are.
A rescue mission.

19:37.208 --> 19:38.250
Okay.

19:40.041 --> 19:41.458
We can help each other.

19:43.041 --> 19:45.791
But this isn't gonna be easy.

19:47.291 --> 19:50.208
Some new friends of mine
told me there's another way in.

19:50.291 --> 19:52.750
A secret door put in by Avatar Kyoshi.

19:54.000 --> 19:55.666
Okay. Let's go.

20:06.500 --> 20:07.541
You want help?

20:08.041 --> 20:09.083
Not from you.

20:09.166 --> 20:11.083
That's never gonna get us out of here.

20:11.166 --> 20:12.500
Oh, really?

20:12.583 --> 20:16.750
It's not gonna get us out of the prison
that you deserve to be in and I don't.

20:17.625 --> 20:18.666
I trusted you.

20:20.083 --> 20:22.458
Was it always supposed to go this way?

20:23.333 --> 20:25.166
Did you always know it was me?

20:25.791 --> 20:28.708
Did you stalk me to find Aang,
and is this the trap?

20:28.791 --> 20:31.125
You think he's gonna come down here
and save me

20:31.208 --> 20:33.583
and then you'll finally have your prize.

20:35.833 --> 20:38.583
That's a more elaborate plan
than I've ever come up with.

20:39.791 --> 20:41.291
I had no plan.

20:41.916 --> 20:44.458
When I saw the Dai Li attack you,
I didn't think. I just helped.

20:44.541 --> 20:45.625
That's why I'm here.

20:45.708 --> 20:46.750
Sure.

20:47.291 --> 20:50.958
I'm supposed to believe that innocent act
from the son of the Fire Lord.

20:51.625 --> 20:55.208
Spreading war and violence
and hatred is in your blood.

20:55.791 --> 21:00.083
Whole generations have been lost
because of your family's lust for power.

21:01.125 --> 21:02.708
Forests burned.

21:03.208 --> 21:05.041
Families separated.

21:05.125 --> 21:07.375
People that just don't exist anymore.

21:08.791 --> 21:10.291
Because of you

21:10.916 --> 21:12.250
and your father

21:12.833 --> 21:13.708
and his father.

21:13.791 --> 21:16.333
And all the little men
that go all the way back to Sozin.

21:19.625 --> 21:23.416
Every Waterbender in my tribe
has been taken or killed.

21:23.916 --> 21:26.250
Children taken.

21:27.750 --> 21:29.208
Except for me.

21:32.000 --> 21:33.541
I hid so I lived.

21:34.166 --> 21:37.208
And I have to live
with the guilt of that every day.

21:37.291 --> 21:40.291
I feel guilty because I lived.

21:41.791 --> 21:42.791
What do you feel?

21:50.000 --> 21:50.916
Nothing?

21:54.125 --> 21:55.458
How dare you!

21:56.500 --> 21:59.666
You have no idea
what this war has put me through.

22:01.041 --> 22:02.416
Me personally.

22:05.833 --> 22:08.416
The Fire Nation took my mother
away from me.

22:15.750 --> 22:16.875
I'm sorry.

22:18.625 --> 22:20.333
Something we have in common.

22:27.291 --> 22:29.833
We'll be the first to use this door
in centuries.

22:30.833 --> 22:32.541
So how did Zuko get captured?

22:34.333 --> 22:36.666
He was caught in the act
of doing something good.

22:38.666 --> 22:40.083
I knew there was more to him.

22:41.041 --> 22:44.083
Looking beneath the surface
is the insight of the Avatar.

22:47.708 --> 22:50.583
I've only made it this far
because of my friends, but

22:52.041 --> 22:54.041
I pushed them away, and they got captured.

22:54.708 --> 22:57.416
That's the insight of the Avatar.

22:57.500 --> 22:59.041
I'm sure it wasn't all your fault.

22:59.125 --> 23:00.125
Oh, it was.

23:00.208 --> 23:02.958
I was completely selfish.

23:03.041 --> 23:05.041
Totally focused on what I needed.

23:06.291 --> 23:07.125
But…

23:09.333 --> 23:10.500
I'm gonna change.

23:12.125 --> 23:15.375
I'm gonna do whatever it takes
to make things right with my friends.

23:15.458 --> 23:17.416
To be whoever they need me to be.

23:17.916 --> 23:19.125
No.

23:19.208 --> 23:22.958
Not only should you not do that,
I'm pretty sure you cannot do that.

23:23.541 --> 23:26.208
If you try, you won't help them.

23:26.291 --> 23:28.500
And you'll lose yourself in the process.

23:29.083 --> 23:31.666
Real friendships survive the truth.

23:31.750 --> 23:34.125
The best ones even grow from it.

23:34.791 --> 23:36.875
You must be who you are,

23:36.958 --> 23:40.916
but you must also
let them be who they are.

23:43.416 --> 23:46.791
But… what if
they don't like who I really am?

23:48.583 --> 23:50.541
That's something you cannot control.

23:54.291 --> 23:56.083
Have you been able to do that?

23:56.583 --> 23:59.458
To be who you really are all this time?

24:02.000 --> 24:03.625
It's a lifelong project.

24:04.125 --> 24:05.833
I'm working on it right now.

24:29.333 --> 24:30.625
Apparently,

24:31.250 --> 24:35.375
Kyoshi used these same prisons in her time
hundreds of years ago.

24:40.083 --> 24:41.416
This is an Avatar door.

24:42.958 --> 24:45.041
We need to bend all four elements
to open it.

24:45.875 --> 24:47.666
Lucky we ran into each other, then.

25:19.958 --> 25:21.083
Wait here, Momo.

25:25.916 --> 25:27.375
No, I know!

25:27.458 --> 25:29.666
It was that flippy girl
with the Kyoshi disguise.

25:29.750 --> 25:33.208
She did this jabbing musclebending thing.
That's why I can't move now.

25:33.291 --> 25:35.333
-Of course.
-Yeah.

25:35.416 --> 25:37.833
-At least I'm here with you, Sai.
-That's true.

25:38.333 --> 25:41.208
-And together we can get out of here.
-That's not possible.

25:41.291 --> 25:44.666
What are you talking about?
Anything's possible for us. For you!

25:44.750 --> 25:47.000
-You're the smartest guy I know.
-I've tried.

25:47.083 --> 25:49.250
Nobly, valiantly.

25:49.958 --> 25:53.458
When they first arrested me,
they interrogated me at the palace,

25:53.541 --> 25:54.875
but I gave nothing up.

25:55.375 --> 25:57.791
So they locked me in the highest tower.

25:57.875 --> 25:59.500
I demanded to see the king.

26:00.541 --> 26:03.458
I understand royalty, of course.
I have some status.

26:03.541 --> 26:05.041
They said, "You'll never see the king."

26:05.125 --> 26:07.416
I said, "I have important info
that could save the world."

26:07.500 --> 26:08.750
And they laughed in my face.

26:08.833 --> 26:10.625
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

26:10.708 --> 26:14.333
And then slammed the door with bending,
so it was extremely loud and unsettling.

26:15.125 --> 26:17.958
But then I asked myself,
what would Teo do?

26:18.041 --> 26:21.833
And despite my low morale,
I made a bold escape attempt.

26:21.916 --> 26:22.916
How?

26:23.000 --> 26:25.458
Bedsheets tied together
and flung out the window.

26:25.541 --> 26:27.333
-Brilliant. Use what's around you.
-Disastrous.

26:27.416 --> 26:29.208
-I miscalculated the distance.
-No.

26:29.291 --> 26:31.666
But then I tried again,
this time with explosives.

26:31.750 --> 26:33.416
-Blasting jelly?
-More homemade

26:33.500 --> 26:36.166
It was a little too homemade.
My eyebrows just started growing back.

26:36.250 --> 26:37.583
Oh. Then what?

26:37.666 --> 26:39.125
Inspiration struck.

26:39.916 --> 26:41.375
-A disguise.
-Yes!

26:41.458 --> 26:42.916
-I was caught immediately.
-No!

26:44.250 --> 26:47.291
Yeah, apparently,
I'm quite distinct-looking. It's…

26:47.791 --> 26:50.083
-Oh, Sai. A little help!
-I got you!

26:51.958 --> 26:52.833
Well…

26:54.541 --> 26:56.375
Then you came up with a new plan, right?

26:58.666 --> 26:59.625
No.

27:00.416 --> 27:02.000
Then they moved me down here.

27:04.875 --> 27:06.708
And I gave in to despair.

27:12.750 --> 27:14.958
My son is out there fighting a war.

27:18.166 --> 27:19.208
Amita.

27:20.666 --> 27:23.916
And we just found each other,
and now I've lost her.

27:24.833 --> 27:27.000
And then when you and the Avatar
needed me…

27:31.000 --> 27:32.208
I failed.

27:33.208 --> 27:34.833
But that's good science.

27:36.250 --> 27:37.208
You failed.

27:38.375 --> 27:41.291
Every failure is an opportunity to learn.

27:42.291 --> 27:45.500
You have to fail a hundred times
to find one thing that works.

27:45.583 --> 27:49.083
Then you have to fail a hundred more
to find the next piece.

27:49.166 --> 27:53.458
You have to fail a thousand times,
and only then you can succeed.

27:55.958 --> 27:57.208
Look around you.

27:57.708 --> 28:00.166
The walls are stone. The doors are metal.

28:03.125 --> 28:04.833
We aren't Benders.

28:05.708 --> 28:06.958
We're gonna die here.

28:14.333 --> 28:16.708
The walls aren't pure stone.
There are crystals too.

28:23.541 --> 28:26.208
You're right. It's not all stone.

28:26.291 --> 28:28.625
The crystals have different
chemical properties than stone?

28:28.708 --> 28:30.333
-Yes. Yes, yes.
-Yes!

28:30.416 --> 28:31.791
We can find a way to dissolve them.

28:31.875 --> 28:34.875
-Then maybe find a way out of here.
-Yes! Yes! Let's get to work!

28:34.958 --> 28:37.416
Sokka, you are my best student.

28:38.208 --> 28:39.666
Maybe my best teacher.

28:39.750 --> 28:41.750
-All right, come. Come on. Ah, ah…
-Yes!

28:45.541 --> 28:46.916
My mother was good.

28:48.666 --> 28:50.541
She saw the best in people.

28:52.625 --> 28:53.708
Even in me.

28:57.541 --> 28:59.708
She was gone before I looked like this.

29:03.458 --> 29:04.500
This scar.

29:06.791 --> 29:09.958
Everyone who sees it
makes assumptions about me.

29:10.500 --> 29:13.708
They make up stories,
so it's easy to pass in the Earth Kingdom.

29:16.250 --> 29:17.916
I look like a victim.

29:20.250 --> 29:22.541
No story they come up with is

29:24.041 --> 29:27.500
anywhere near as terrible as the truth.

29:35.166 --> 29:36.958
My father did this to me.

29:40.208 --> 29:44.875
Do you know how hard it is
for a Firebender to get burned?

29:47.125 --> 29:48.416
Really burned.

29:49.916 --> 29:50.916
Scarred

29:51.791 --> 29:53.000
for life.

29:54.166 --> 29:56.500
He has to let down his basic defenses,

29:56.583 --> 29:59.166
instincts he's born with.

30:01.791 --> 30:03.416
It's like a Waterbender drowning.

30:07.166 --> 30:08.958
My father may have scarred me…

30:11.541 --> 30:12.708
but deep down…

30:16.750 --> 30:19.666
some part of me

30:20.958 --> 30:22.458
believed I deserved it.

30:35.125 --> 30:36.625
That part of me let him.

30:58.583 --> 31:00.333
Because my father hates me,

31:01.375 --> 31:03.041
everybody else does too.

31:04.250 --> 31:06.291
Those Fire Nation defectors?

31:07.166 --> 31:10.250
They would hate me if they knew who I was.

31:17.833 --> 31:19.541
Why were you defending them?

31:20.500 --> 31:22.333
Because they were helpless.

31:23.375 --> 31:24.625
Why were you?

31:27.250 --> 31:28.458
Same reason.

31:33.791 --> 31:36.666
For so long,
when I saw the face of the enemy…

31:38.916 --> 31:40.208
it was your face.

31:46.833 --> 31:48.625
No matter how much

31:49.875 --> 31:52.041
you hate this face, Katara…

31:54.291 --> 31:56.500
I hate it more.

31:59.583 --> 32:01.333
It's not what I see now.

32:03.541 --> 32:05.333
I see someone in pain.

32:07.666 --> 32:09.416
Someone who needs healing.

32:19.666 --> 32:21.833
This is water from the Spirit Oasis.

32:22.791 --> 32:27.125
It's been known to cure the deepest
and most dire of wounds.

32:28.958 --> 32:31.708
Maybe even those
that reach back generations.

32:41.708 --> 32:42.625
Can I…

32:45.083 --> 32:46.500
try to heal you?

32:54.500 --> 32:57.333
I am expecting full regalia
for all officers.

32:59.750 --> 33:01.666
There you are, Cultural Minister.

33:02.250 --> 33:04.291
This is General Vinh Tran.

33:04.375 --> 33:06.875
He will be the steward of Ba Sing Se
in my absence.

33:08.125 --> 33:10.333
Speak to him as you would me.

33:11.708 --> 33:12.625
Hmm?

33:19.083 --> 33:20.375
Cultural Minister,

33:20.458 --> 33:23.333
let's ensure that all thoroughfares
are clear of debris

33:23.416 --> 33:25.666
and that any mobile vendors
will be kept away.

33:25.750 --> 33:30.041
We don't want any disruptions
when our forces enter the streets.

33:32.791 --> 33:34.166
Cultural Minister?

33:38.041 --> 33:39.250
I'll see to it.

33:41.500 --> 33:44.791
When our forces arrive, I expect
your men to be deferential to mine.

33:45.500 --> 33:47.416
From the highest rank to the lowest.

33:49.250 --> 33:51.208
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

33:51.291 --> 33:53.916
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

33:54.416 --> 33:56.875
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

33:56.958 --> 33:59.125
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

34:00.000 --> 34:02.500
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

34:02.583 --> 34:04.833
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

34:04.916 --> 34:07.500
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

34:07.583 --> 34:09.708
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

34:10.291 --> 34:12.666
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

34:12.750 --> 34:14.750
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

34:14.833 --> 34:17.875
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

34:17.958 --> 34:20.625
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

34:20.708 --> 34:23.416
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

34:26.333 --> 34:27.500
No.

34:27.583 --> 34:30.541
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

34:37.958 --> 34:39.708
There is no war

34:40.875 --> 34:42.791
in Ba Sing Se.

34:44.500 --> 34:48.333
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

34:49.083 --> 34:53.458
There is no war in Ba Sing Se.

34:53.958 --> 34:58.458
There is no war in Ba Sing Se!

34:59.416 --> 35:01.833
Looks like you could use
a little more time down here.

35:01.916 --> 35:02.916
Please!

35:03.000 --> 35:04.791
Please don't leave me here!

35:05.500 --> 35:07.333
Please! Please!

35:07.875 --> 35:11.166
I can do anything
or any jobs for the minister!

35:11.791 --> 35:14.291
There's no war in Ba Sing Se!

35:14.375 --> 35:17.125
There is no war in Ba Sing Se!

35:17.208 --> 35:19.791
Okay, be precise or lose an eye.

35:19.875 --> 35:22.500
We just need a chunk of crystal
so we can analyze and experiment

35:22.583 --> 35:24.000
with whatever we have on hand.

35:24.083 --> 35:25.083
Great.

35:25.166 --> 35:26.166
Yeah.

35:28.250 --> 35:29.583
Is this a good idea?

35:30.416 --> 35:32.416
It's the best one we have.

35:32.500 --> 35:34.500
-Sokka!
-Not now, Aang!

35:35.375 --> 35:36.416
-Aang!
-Aang?

35:37.958 --> 35:40.416
-I'm so glad to see you, man!
-Me too.

35:42.791 --> 35:44.458
-Sokka…
-I know.

35:44.958 --> 35:47.708
It's good. We're… we're good.
We're good, right?

35:49.666 --> 35:51.500
He's with us on our mission. Trust me.

35:52.458 --> 35:53.666
Zuko was also taken.

35:53.750 --> 35:57.708
I know it's hard to believe,
but my nephew, there's good inside him.

35:57.791 --> 35:59.500
Let me know
when there's good outside of him.

35:59.583 --> 36:00.666
Sokka,

36:01.916 --> 36:03.166
Katara is down here.

36:06.875 --> 36:09.416
If you can help us find our friends
and get out of here,

36:09.500 --> 36:10.500
I'll believe whatever.

36:12.041 --> 36:13.916
All right, let's go.

36:14.416 --> 36:18.000
I wonder if this is the reason
I was given this water in the first place.

36:19.250 --> 36:20.833
Because it was meant for you.

36:22.833 --> 36:24.083
I don't deserve it.

36:27.125 --> 36:28.333
You will.

36:45.291 --> 36:46.625
Hey, get away from her!

36:46.708 --> 36:50.416
Sokka! Stop! He helped me.
That's why he got arrested.

36:50.500 --> 36:51.583
He what?

36:51.666 --> 36:54.125
Get your hands off me
before I burn them off.

36:54.208 --> 36:56.250
Zuko. Both of you.

36:57.041 --> 36:59.208
He's been helping people. I've seen it.

37:14.333 --> 37:15.666
-I'm sorry.
-I'm sorry.

37:21.791 --> 37:23.708
Gotcha.

37:23.791 --> 37:28.000
The coast is clear. Is this everyone,
or do we have more rescuing to do?

37:28.875 --> 37:32.708
Toph left the city with her mother,
but Appa's in a cell somewhere down here,

37:32.791 --> 37:33.916
and we're gonna get him.

37:35.833 --> 37:37.250
What are you two gonna do?

37:40.208 --> 37:41.666
He helped me find you.

37:46.916 --> 37:48.291
We should all get out of here.

37:57.000 --> 37:58.250
Katara…

38:00.541 --> 38:02.166
I just need to say I'm sorry.

38:02.958 --> 38:05.791
I was being really unfair.
And I never should've pushed you away.

38:06.375 --> 38:07.375
It's okay.

38:08.625 --> 38:09.833
I'm sorry too.

38:11.000 --> 38:12.958
-But we better go.
-Please, just… just wait.

38:14.416 --> 38:15.708
I need to say this.

38:17.166 --> 38:20.666
If you took all of this away,
and I wasn't the Avatar,

38:20.750 --> 38:24.750
and you weren't a Waterbender,
and we didn't need to save the world,

38:26.166 --> 38:27.125
I…

38:34.583 --> 38:37.208
We would still be friends.

38:40.375 --> 38:41.583
Of course we would.

38:42.583 --> 38:44.416
No argument could ever change that.

38:45.291 --> 38:46.291
Yeah.

38:47.833 --> 38:50.041
I can feel him. Appa's this way.

38:52.333 --> 38:53.291
Guards.

38:53.375 --> 38:54.375
Go, go, go!

39:10.583 --> 39:11.708
Joo Dee.

39:12.958 --> 39:15.208
Hey, we can get you out of here.

39:15.791 --> 39:17.250
You can come with us.

39:22.875 --> 39:26.625
The Avatar's here! Don't let him get away!

39:26.708 --> 39:28.666
The Avatar is here!

39:28.750 --> 39:30.250
He's over here!

39:42.208 --> 39:43.375
Separate them!

39:59.750 --> 40:01.958
You… you poisoned me!

40:02.041 --> 40:04.208
It's crested lark poppy.

40:04.708 --> 40:07.500
I use it for beauty sleep.
Don't be so dramatic.

40:07.583 --> 40:10.291
I'm your daughter, and you kidnapped me?

40:10.375 --> 40:11.291
Yes.

40:12.583 --> 40:13.708
You're my daughter.

40:14.458 --> 40:16.000
I'm glad you realize that.

40:17.125 --> 40:19.916
After a time, you'll be grateful
for what I did for you today.

40:21.041 --> 40:23.750
The planning, the excuses,

40:23.833 --> 40:28.291
the lengths I've gone
to protect my only daughter from herself.

40:30.541 --> 40:32.291
I'm not your property!

40:34.250 --> 40:35.833
You lied!

40:36.458 --> 40:38.041
You lied!

40:38.791 --> 40:40.041
You don't care.

40:40.958 --> 40:42.250
You never did.

40:43.791 --> 40:45.291
You never wanted me.

40:50.166 --> 40:51.583
You're ashamed of me.

40:53.666 --> 40:55.125
I mean, why?

40:56.166 --> 40:58.375
I mean, you don't even know me.

41:02.458 --> 41:04.000
You don't even know me.

41:13.416 --> 41:14.458
They do.

41:19.791 --> 41:21.375
They do.

41:25.916 --> 41:28.125
They know who I am.

41:39.500 --> 41:42.708
I know who I am!

41:54.333 --> 41:56.375
That's… that's impossible!

41:56.458 --> 42:00.041
I'm Toph Beifong,
and I invented Metalbending.

42:17.166 --> 42:20.041
I'm the greatest Earthbender in the world!

42:49.000 --> 42:50.500
He's through there.

42:54.166 --> 42:55.708
I've kept an eye on him.

42:58.458 --> 43:01.916
We can all get out of here together.

43:03.250 --> 43:04.083
What?

43:06.208 --> 43:08.666
Princess Azula
has taken control of the city.

43:09.333 --> 43:10.458
Azula?

43:11.041 --> 43:12.208
Azula, here?

43:12.291 --> 43:13.291
How?

43:13.375 --> 43:14.833
She came here for you.

43:15.583 --> 43:18.416
I did what I could
to protect you from her.

43:20.000 --> 43:21.833
The military is destroyed.

43:23.000 --> 43:24.416
And she's going to open the gates,

43:24.500 --> 43:26.916
and the Fire Nation
will march on the palace.

43:28.000 --> 43:29.708
Our only hope now

43:30.250 --> 43:33.541
is to run and fight another day.

43:36.041 --> 43:38.833
Did you really think
I would ever trust you again?

43:39.875 --> 43:41.458
You betrayed us all.

43:41.541 --> 43:44.125
If Azula took over, it's your fault.

43:44.708 --> 43:49.208
I did what was needed to protect the city,
to keep the war outside the walls!

43:49.708 --> 43:52.833
Everyone in Ba Sing Se lives in peace
because of me!

43:53.750 --> 43:56.625
I shoulder the burden!
I do what must be done!

43:57.500 --> 44:00.625
And you understand that.

44:01.791 --> 44:02.625
No.

44:04.125 --> 44:06.250
Because I care about the people.

44:06.791 --> 44:11.083
All you care about is having power
and using it to save yourself.

44:12.083 --> 44:15.166
I would never help you escape.

44:15.875 --> 44:17.250
And I'm not gonna run.

44:18.000 --> 44:20.541
I'm gonna stay here and stop Azula.

44:20.625 --> 44:22.875
You will never defeat her.

44:23.708 --> 44:25.958
You are too kind,

44:26.041 --> 44:28.583
and that makes you weak.

44:39.958 --> 44:42.791
You will see that I was right, Aang.

44:43.916 --> 44:46.500
You can't win.

44:49.958 --> 44:53.416
Run. Run while you still have a chance.

45:21.708 --> 45:22.750
Appa!

45:33.416 --> 45:35.125
I missed you so much.

45:46.500 --> 45:47.541
I know.

46:05.750 --> 46:07.583
I need to go save the others.

46:07.666 --> 46:09.958
And I'll be right there behind you.

46:10.458 --> 46:12.125
We're together forever.

46:14.208 --> 46:15.250
Promise.

46:25.291 --> 46:26.375
I'll be okay.

46:28.708 --> 46:29.583
Appa.

46:30.125 --> 46:30.958
Go.

46:57.541 --> 47:00.166
Why couldn't you have stayed in your room
like a good boy?

47:27.291 --> 47:28.708
Okay. I surrender. I surrender.

47:32.541 --> 47:33.750
Boomerang!

47:34.666 --> 47:35.833
You do always come back.

47:36.708 --> 47:38.875
Sh. Someone else is coming.

47:40.750 --> 47:43.458
Aang! Oh, you're safe. Where's Appa?

47:43.541 --> 47:45.833
I sent him up to the surface with Momo.

47:45.916 --> 47:48.875
-Where's Iroh and Zuko?
-We were separated. It's been eventful.

47:48.958 --> 47:51.125
We need to get out.
They can take care of themselves.

47:51.208 --> 47:53.000
No. The city's not safe.

47:53.083 --> 47:56.083
Azula and the Fire Nation have taken over.
And we need to stop her now.

47:56.166 --> 47:57.125
Azula?

47:57.708 --> 47:59.708
There you are. I think I found a way out.

48:00.416 --> 48:01.250
Let's go.

48:01.333 --> 48:02.333
Okay.

48:40.958 --> 48:43.166
How long are we gonna
keep doing this, Zuko?

48:43.875 --> 48:46.125
How long are we gonna
keep playing his game?

48:46.208 --> 48:47.500
Fighting each other.

48:48.291 --> 48:50.541
Until one of us wins.

48:54.125 --> 48:55.875
Mother always thought I was a monster.

48:55.958 --> 48:59.541
Don't talk about her. Ever.

49:18.166 --> 49:20.916
Maybe it wouldn't have come to this
if she hadn't been taken.

49:24.958 --> 49:25.916
I'm sorry.

49:27.166 --> 49:29.958
I'm sorry I couldn't stay quiet
that night in the carriage.

49:31.083 --> 49:32.291
It's my fault.

49:36.708 --> 49:39.000
But she told us to stay together.

49:41.208 --> 49:43.333
That we would always have each other.

49:54.541 --> 49:56.375
Maybe we could, Zuko.

49:58.291 --> 49:59.750
I've taken the city.

50:00.958 --> 50:04.458
Our forces are marching
through the streets at this very moment.

50:04.958 --> 50:07.750
The Earth Kingdom is going to fall.

50:08.750 --> 50:11.375
It's a glorious day
in our nation's history.

50:16.500 --> 50:17.875
We could share it.

50:26.625 --> 50:29.625
But I'm not going to force you
to come home if you don't want to.

50:33.416 --> 50:34.833
The choice is yours.

50:52.625 --> 50:53.958
This is the way out.

50:54.708 --> 50:55.541
I can feel it.

51:01.541 --> 51:02.833
I'm gonna get Sai out of here!

51:21.250 --> 51:22.083
Get down!

52:29.291 --> 52:30.791
Thankfully your limbs are operational.

52:30.875 --> 52:33.250
-I know. The drop helped. Yeah.
-Yeah.

52:33.750 --> 52:34.958
Okay.

52:35.041 --> 52:36.958
Oh no, it's locked.

52:40.625 --> 52:41.541
Oh.

52:53.375 --> 52:54.291
Hmm.

52:54.958 --> 52:56.416
Miss me, Snoozles?

52:57.250 --> 52:58.666
You bent metal?

52:58.750 --> 53:01.208
We can talk about how much I rule later.

53:01.291 --> 53:03.333
Let's go. Appa's waiting outside.

53:04.041 --> 53:05.166
Snoozle?

53:06.708 --> 53:07.958
I'll tell you later.

53:55.541 --> 53:57.541
I thought you had changed!

54:05.916 --> 54:07.375
I have changed.

54:56.208 --> 54:58.333
Surrender, Avatar.

54:59.083 --> 55:00.500
I've already won.

55:01.666 --> 55:05.791
The question is,
how much are you willing to lose?

55:14.291 --> 55:18.416
I won't lose anyone.

58:21.625 --> 58:23.833
If you die in the Avatar State,

58:25.208 --> 58:27.291
the cycle will cease,

58:28.708 --> 58:32.416
and the world
will fall out of balance forever.

59:07.583 --> 59:08.750
Get him out of here!

01:01:37.583 --> 01:01:38.458
Aang.

01:01:45.708 --> 01:01:46.708
Aang?

01:01:56.458 --> 01:01:57.416
Aang!

01:02:01.416 --> 01:02:02.333
Aang!

01:02:05.416 --> 01:02:06.375
Aang!
